# polecenia.log — SSH tunnels for your own server: -L, -R and -D, reach a database that only listens on localhost
# obraz: localhost/shellproven-ssh-tunnels:13 (sha256:71bd742aca87e8831b29387ad991edf6666ca307ed6b123a03e6f984bb42c921), Debian 13.7, uruchomiono 2026-11-22T00:36:26Z
# wersje: OpenSSH_10.0p2 Debian-7+deb13u4, OpenSSL 3.5.7 9 Jun 2026
